# INV alone, LEFT and SPACE during the cannon's explosion (BUGS.md I2).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame inv --headless --ms 15000 --input tools/play/inv-explosion-move.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame inv --headless --ms 15000 --fix all,-inv_arcade_rules,-inv_clean_render,-inv_controls_screen --input tools/play/inv-explosion-move.input
# (The --fix all run pins the Corrigida's arcade INV off, `inv_arcade_rules`, `inv_clean_render` and
# `inv_controls_screen`: it replaces the 1995 game this script plays; see inv-corrigida-*.input.)
#
# With no key the first bomb hits the cannon between 2370 and 2390 ms
# (inv-alone-lose.input); LEFT is held from 2400, in the explosion's
# first cannon tick, and SPACE pressed at 2600, before the 7 frames end:
# - Original: the cannon drives off showing the frozen explosion frame
#   and fires; the shot kills an invader and the bombs end the game at
#   8440 ms with -1900;
# - `--fix all`: the cannon holds still and cannot fire until the explosion
#   ends; the game goes as with no key: -2000 at 12275 ms.
2400 hold left 150
2500 dump moved
2600 key space
13000 result lost -1900 | lost -2000
